    "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"primary\">\n<div class=\"basic-content-row\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<article class=\"page type-page status-publish hentry\" id=\"post-2004\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Portfolio</h1> </header>\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Portfolio</p>\n<h2 class=\"vbg-display-title\">Spaces, settings, and building ideas</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Browse the photographic library by project type and space. Editorial concepts are identified discreetly when you hover or focus on an image; they are not presented as completed Verity projects.</p>\n<div class=\"vbg-gallery-filter-set\" data-gallery-controls=\"\">\n<div aria-label=\"Filter portfolio by project type\" class=\"vbg-gallery-filters vbg-gallery-filters--primary\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"is-active\" data-primary-filter=\"all\">All</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-primary-filter=\"residential\">Residential</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-primary-filter=\"land\">Land</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-primary-filter=\"legacy\">Legacy</button></div>\n<div aria-label=\"Filter residential images by space\" class=\"vbg-gallery-subfilters\" data-subfilters=\"residential\" hidden=\"\" role=\"group\">Residential spaces<button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"is-active\" data-secondary-filter=\"all\">All Residential</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"exterior\">Exterior</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"kitchen\">Kitchen</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"bath\">Bath</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"living\">Living</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"specialty\">Specialty Spaces</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-secondary-filter=\"outdoor-living\">Outdoor Living</button></div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"vbg-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"vbg-g